OL,3,GNEWSADisruption as new Derwent bridge
OL,4,Aworks begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaths along the banks of the River
OL,7,FDerwent in Derby are set to shut for
OL,8,Fabout a week as work to build a
OL,9,Freplacement bridge begins.
OL,11,FThe Darley Abbey Mills Bridge was
OL,12,Fdeemed to be at "high risk of collapse"
OL,13,Fand closed in 2022, with demolition
OL,14,Fcompleted in August to make way for a
OL,15,Freplacement.
OL,17,FA temporary bridge, known as Walter's
OL,18,FWalkway, was installed following the
OL,19,Fclosure and was removed in July to
OL,20,Fallow the new permanent crossing to be
OL,21,Fbuilt.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
